{"seq":25,"slug":"code-refactoring-legacy","title":"代码重构与遗留系统","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.85,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 代码重构与遗留系统 简介\n\n代码重构与遗留系统治理是软件工程领域中最具实践价值的技能之一。随着软件项目规模的持续增长和业务需求的不断演进，代码库不可避免地会积累复杂性和技术债务。掌握系统化的重构方法论和遗留系统现代化策略，是每一位追求工程卓越的开发者必须具备的核心能力。\n\n本知识体系面向具有一定编程经验、希望提升代码质量和系统架构能力的软件工程师。无论你是需要改善日常代码的应用开发者，还是面对大型遗留系统改造挑战的架构师，都能从中获得系统性的方法指导。\n\n第一章**重构基础理论**建立重构的认知框架——从 Martin Fowler 定义的重构原则出发，学习识别代码坏味道的能力，并掌握以测试为核心的重构安全保障体系。\n\n第二章**重构技巧实战**深入具体的重构手法——包括提取与内联系列操作、条件逻辑与循环的简化策略、以及面向对象层面的结构调整技巧，构建完整的重构工具箱。\n\n第三章**遗留系统现代化**聚焦大型系统的渐进式改造——从系统评估框架出发，掌握 Strangler Fig 等经典模式，并通过增量迁移策略实现数据库、API 层和微服务的平滑过渡。\n\n第四章**技术债务管理**将重构提升到组织层面——学习技术债的分类与量化方法、基于 ROI 的偿还优先级决策框架，以及如何在团队中建立持续重构的工程文化。\n\n推荐学习路径：先通过第一章建立理论基础，再以第二章习得具体技巧，接着学习第三章的系统级改造方法，最后通过第四章掌握组织层面的管理策略。在学习过程中，建议结合实际项目进行练习，将每种重构手法应用到真实代码中以加深理解。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"refactoring-fundamentals","title":"重构基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/refactoring-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"refactoring-theory","title":"重构基础理论与核心原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/refactoring-fundamentals/refactoring-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-smells","title":"代码坏味道识别与分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/refactoring-fundamentals/code-smells"},{"seq":3,"slug":"refactoring-safety-net","title":"重构安全网：测试与持续集成保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/refactoring-fundamentals/refactoring-safety-net"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"refactoring-techniques","title":"重构技巧实战","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/refactoring-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"extract-and-inline","title":"提取与内联：重构的基础操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/refactoring-techniques/extract-and-inline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"simplify-conditionals","title":"简化条件逻辑与循环结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/refactoring-techniques/simplify-conditionals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"object-restructuring","title":"对象与继承结构重构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/refactoring-techniques/object-restructuring"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"legacy-system-modernization","title":"遗留系统现代化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/legacy-system-modernization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"legacy-assessment","title":"遗留系统评估策略与决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/legacy-system-modernization/legacy-assessment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"strangler-fig-pattern","title":"Strangler Fig 模式：渐进式系统替换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/legacy-system-modernization/strangler-fig-pattern"},{"seq":3,"slug":"incremental-migration","title":"增量迁移实战：数据库、API 与微服务拆分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/legacy-system-modernization/incremental-migration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"technical-debt-management","title":"技术债务管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/technical-debt-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"debt-classification","title":"技术债分类与量化方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/technical-debt-management/debt-classification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"repayment-strategy","title":"技术债偿还策略与优先级决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/technical-debt-management/repayment-strategy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"refactoring-culture","title":"团队重构文化与组织实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/code-refactoring-legacy/technical-debt-management/refactoring-culture"}]}]}